igned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x(6\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (6{csc}^{2}⁡x-5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 6{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)-5(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575596 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064178 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "0cae5c1b-57bd-51f6-a360-db946d25532f" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Sine and Cosine"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "322df916-39b9-599e-a476-810f5cef3397" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575036} {:answer/id #uuid "7c2fc9f8-9ba6-5343-a7ed-17d93cc87a5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575174} {:answer/id #uuid "a9719d4f-c0e6-58b1-9042-0f8dc0cc5b3a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575248} {:answer/id #uuid "cfa7ffc1-052c-532e-8da6-94ac7004b9a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575317} {:answer/id #uuid "e5572e89-e95f-550c-955c-320f0b7a840a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575356}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cfa7ffc1-052c-532e-8da6-94ac7004b9a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575317} :answer-field/id #uuid "1700a89d-2650-5aef-adea-d21bee253a61" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575415}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bd10b8fd-b17b-505d-be34-31b755b59a68" :question/math-academy-id "q-71655" :question/problem "$\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =8\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C \\\\  & =-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575547 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064180 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "caf358b8-31fb-5587-8663-f414317c42be" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Secant Squared"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00c21b53-f065-504c-a5e3-aa2005a3edca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574951} {:answer/id #uuid "1f40bf7b-d